# Hoyolab localization (RU)

When adding or correcting Russian display names, use **HoYoWiki** (official), not fandom wiki:

| Type | URL |
|------|-----|
| Characters | https://wiki.hoyolab.com/pc/genshin/aggregate/2 |
| Weapons | https://wiki.hoyolab.com/pc/genshin/aggregate/4 |
| Artifacts (sets) | https://wiki.hoyolab.com/pc/genshin/aggregate/5 |

API (lang `ru-ru`): `POST https://sg-wiki-api.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/genshin/wapi/get_entry_page_list` with `menu_id` `2` / `4` / `5`, headers `x-rpc-language: ru-ru` and `x-rpc-wiki_app: genshin`.

- Character names → `src/data/names.ts` (`CHARACTER_NAMES`)
- Weapon names → `src/data/catalog.ts` (`WEAPONS[].name`)
- Set names → `src/data/catalog.ts` (`SET_NAMES`)

Do not add Manekin/Manekina to the app; they stay filtered out on GOOD import.
